              </ul>
            </nav>
          </aside>

          <div class="article-content">
            <div class="content-section" id="details" data-aos="fade-up">
              <p class="lead">
                This is to inform the Polytechnic Community that the 47th
                Matriculation Ceremony for the 2024/2025 Academic Session of the
                UNIVERSITY OF AGRICULTURE AND ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE (UAES),
                UMUAGWO, Owerri, which was earlier postponed, has been
                rescheduled as follows:
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Date:</strong> Thursday, 10th April, 2025</li>
                <li><strong>Time:</strong> 10:00 AM</li>
                <li>
                  <strong>Venue:</strong> University of Innovation, Science and
                  Technology, Omuma Mini Stadium
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                All students, parents, guardians, friends, and well-wishers of
                the Institution are cordially invited to attend this important
                event.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section" id="attendance" data-aos="fade-up">
              <h2>Attendance Notice</h2>
              <p>
                Management has directed that all students, particularly
                matriculating students, must be present during the ceremony.
                Deans and Heads of Departments are requested to take attendance
                and communicate accordingly to their staff and students.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section" id="instructions" data-aos="fade-up">
              <h2>Instructions for Matriculating Students</h2>
              <p>
                All matriculating students are advised to collect their
                matriculation gowns from their respective School Officers prior
                to the ceremony.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section" id="contacts" data-aos="fade-up">
              <h2>Contact Information</h2>
              <p>
                For further inquiries or assistance, please contact the
                Registrar's office.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
